assert (0 <= index && index < \old(this.size())) => 
    \forall int j; index < j && j < this.size(); 
        (this.elementAt(j) == null ? \old(this.elementAt(j)) == null 
                                   : this.elementAt(j).equals(\old(this.elementAt(j))));
```
